<head><title>NOMADS Error Fixture</title></head>
<body>
This fixture simulates an upstream payload shape regression where the endpoint responds with HTML
instead of a GRIB2 payload. The file is intentionally large enough to ensure the probe detects a
format regression rather than only a small-payload failure.
